#: ../../admin/upgrade/3.2-to-3.3/index.rst:4 a1d36f917be845fd8aaaafcf95de8c57
msgid "Upgrade from 3.2.x / 3.3.x"
msgstr "Actualització des de 3.2.x / 3.3.x"

#: ../../admin/upgrade/3.2-to-3.3/index.rst:6 fa3dc72085904bbc873a9b51cacb948e
msgid "Upgrade the dependencies"
msgstr "Actualitzar les dependències"

#: ../../admin/upgrade/3.2-to-3.3/index.rst:7 cf35f5dd66b440efb984cee332ea0864
msgid ""
"Perform the ``migrations`` management command; in case some attribute is "
"conflicting, remove it manually from the DB"
msgstr ""
"Utilitzeu la comanda de gestió ''migracions''; en cas que algun atribut "
"estigui en conflicte, elimineu-lo manualment de la base de dades"

#: ../../admin/upgrade/3.2-to-3.3/index.rst:8 d0ca3fb128cd44cca7b70ea4da2297a6
msgid "Proform the ``collectstatic`` management command"
msgstr "Creeu la comanda de gestió ''collectstatic''"

#: ../../admin/upgrade/3.2-to-3.3/index.rst:11
#: 2bd76102b4394aa09548b0f75a86b397
msgid "Upgrade the instance dependencies"
msgstr "Actualitzeu les dependències de la instància"

#: ../../admin/upgrade/3.2-to-3.3/index.rst:13
#: 7c380bbad7d4412d804059910a9810a9
msgid ""
"Check the :ref:`install_dep` and :ref:`install_venv` sections in order to "
"upgrade your Python environment."
msgstr ""
"Comproveu les seccions :ref:'install_dep' i :ref:'install_venv' per tal "
"d'actualitzar el vostre entorn Python."

#: ../../admin/upgrade/3.2-to-3.3/index.rst:15
#: d25fe4545c0b4200a967e3999912ca70
msgid ""
"Also, make sure the code is ``Python 3.8`` compatible and that you switched "
"and aligned the **source code** and the **requirements.txt** to the "
"``master`` branch."
msgstr ""
"A més, assegureu-vos que el codi és compatible amb ''Python 3.8'' i que heu "
"canviat i alineat el **codi font** i el **requirements.txt** a la branca "
"''master''."

#: ../../admin/upgrade/3.2-to-3.3/index.rst:17
#: 3c23f8bdc285479da6afd242ad97e6df
msgid "This must be done manually and with particular attention."
msgstr "Això s'ha de fer manualment i amb especial atenció."

